
Action: file_editor create /app/memory/PRD.md --file-text "# HR Assistant Chatbot – PRD

## Original Problem Statement
Build an intelligent HR assistant chatbot that answers employee queries on HR policies (leave, salary, attendance, work-from-home, benefits). Answers must be policy-grounded, concise, ask follow-ups when unclear, escalate sensitive issues to HR, and follow the format: Direct answer / Additional guidance / Escalation suggestion.

## Architecture
- **Backend**: FastAPI + MongoDB. LLM via `emergentintegrations` → Anthropic `claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929` using Emergent Universal LLM Key.
- **Frontend**: React + Tailwind + Shadcn primitives. Single-page 3-pane Swiss/Brutalist layout.
- **Routes (all `/api`)**: `/policies`, `/chat/sessions` (GET, POST), `/chat/sessions/{id}` (GET, DELETE), `/chat/message` (POST).

## User Persona
Employee at the company who needs quick policy answers without filing HR tickets.

## Core Requirements
- Strictly policy-grounded answers (5 seeded policies: leave, salary, attendance, WFH, benefits)
- Output in 3-section format
- Persistent multi-session chat history per browser
- Escalate sensitive issues (salary disputes, complaints) to hr@company.com

## What's Implemented (2026-02-25)
- 5 seeded HR policies returned by `/api/policies`
- Multi-turn chat with persistence (sessions + messages in MongoDB)
- Session sidebar (create / load / delete)
- Empty state with quick-prompt chips and suggested questions
- Right-side Policy Library with expandable cards
- Mailto escalation banner + footer contact
- Typing indicator, message animations, sharp Swiss aesthetic with Chivo + IBM Plex Sans
- 100% pass on backend (8/8) + frontend e2e tests

## Backlog
### P1
- Admin UI to edit/upload company policies (currently hard-coded list)
- Authentication (employee login) + per-user history isolation
- Streaming responses for longer answers

### P2
- File/PDF policy ingestion with RAG over uploaded HR handbook
- Slack/Teams integration so employees can ask Aria from chat tools
- Analytics: top asked categories, escalation rate, response satisfaction
- Rate limiting on `/api/chat/message`

## Next Tasks
- Decide auth requirement and policy-edit admin flow with stakeholders
